  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/09/2003867397\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">国安会收紧反渗透措施</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">NSC tightens anti-infiltration measures</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">台湾国家安全会议宣布强化反渗透策略，旨在应对日益加剧的外部干预威胁，保护关键基础设施与国家安全，此举是在当前两岸关系紧张背景下采取的重要预防性措施。（台湾官方）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3373721/attack-iraq-gas-complex-disrupts-supply-regions-power-plants-authorities-say\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">伊拉克天然气设施遭袭，影响区域电厂供气</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Attack on Iraq gas complex disrupts supply to region’s power plants, authorities say</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">伊拉克北部一处天然气综合设施遭遇袭击，导致对该区域发电厂的天然气供应中断，这可能引发当地电力短缺并加剧地区安全担忧。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq5ynw94k7kzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">习近平强调“党纪”，中国政治会议清洗人数创纪录</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Record number of purges as Xi emphasises &#x27;party discipline&#x27; at China political gathering</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在中国的一次重要政治会议上，习近平主席强调加强“党纪”，随后被清洗的官员人数达到历史新高，显示出中共内部持续高压反腐和权力集中态势。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/china/2026/10/23/china-taiwan-sanctions-paraguay-belize/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国制裁台湾邦交国，旨在展示其影响力但效果有限</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China’s sanctions on Taiwan allies project its power, but with limited effect</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国对台湾的邦交国实施制裁，旨在彰显其地缘政治影响力并孤立台湾，然而分析认为此举在短期内对改变台湾国际地位的效果可能有限。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/27/kim-jong-uns-curious-visit-to-china\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">金正恩对中国的神秘访问</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Kim Jong Un’s curious visit to China</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">朝鲜领导人金正恩对中国进行了一次未对外公布细节的访问，引发外界对其访问目的和议程的广泛猜测，可能涉及两国关系或区域安全议题。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/technology/2026/11/fridge-hacks-europe-supermarkets/689328/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">为何冰箱也争相接入互联网？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Why Is Everyone Connecting Fridges to the Internet?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">智能家居日益普及，冰箱等传统家电也纷纷接入互联网，实现远程控制、食材管理等功能，旨在提升用户便利性与生活效率，反映了物联网技术在消费领域的深入应用。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/11/06/germany-movies-prosecution-film-far-right-afd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">德国电影《家园》预示极右翼未来，引发社会讨论</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">A German Movie Previews Its Far-Right Future</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">德国新电影《家园》以虚构的方式描绘了极右翼势力在德国掌权后的社会景象，引发公众对德国政治未来走向的深刻反思和讨论。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/08/massie-president-2028-libertarian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“让美国再次伟大”运动中的落选者密谋2028年大选搅局</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">MAGA castoffs plot 2028 spoiler bid</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">多位在“让美国再次伟大”（MAGA）运动中失意的政治人物，正酝酿在2028年美国总统大选中扮演“搅局者”角色，可能对共和党初选及大选结果产生复杂影响。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/08/nx-s1-6034014/europe-join-us-brokered-ukraine-talks-abu-dhabi-russia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">欧洲将参与美国主导的阿布扎比乌克兰和谈，无视克里姆林宫反对</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Europe to join U.S.-brokered Ukraine talks in Abu Dhabi, defying Kremlin objections</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex