pace:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2338126/vps-defense-begins-amid-calls-for-her-to-testify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">副总统的辩护开始，此前有呼吁要求她作证</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">VP’s defense begins amid calls for her to testify</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在要求副总统作证的呼声高涨之际，针对她的辩护工作已经启动，这表明副总统正面临某种形式的质疑或指控，此次辩护将是其回应外界压力的关键一步，事件走向值得关注。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/09/man-charged-fatal-stabbing-hungrypanda-delivery-driver-jianming-feng-melbourne-ntwnfb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">墨尔本一华人外卖骑手遇刺身亡，涉案男子被控谋杀</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Man charged with murder over fatal stabbing of HungryPanda delivery rider in Melbourne</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在墨尔本发生的一起致命刺杀事件中，华人外卖平台“熊猫外卖”的骑手不幸遇害。一名男子因此被指控谋杀罪，此事件引发了对外卖员安全问题的广泛关注。（澳大利亚媒体报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲卫报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/09/who-is-behind-the-new-campaign-to-get-rid-of-mmp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">揭秘Zuru豪宅：富豪榜名流为何发起废除MMP选举制度的运动？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">In the Zuru mansion with the rich listers behind the new campaign to get rid of MMP</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰知名玩具公司Zuru的创始人等富豪榜名流，正在推动一项旨在废除联立制（MMP）选举制度的运动。本文深入探讨了这些商界精英在豪宅中密谋此举的动机和潜在影响，引发公众对选举制度改革的讨论。（新西兰媒体报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/politics_election-2026/2449204/election-live-christopher-luxon-says-he-will-call-qiulae-wong-shortly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">选举直播：克里斯托弗·卢克森称将“很快”致电黄琴来</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Election live: Christopher Luxon says he will call Qiulae Wong &#x27;shortly&#x27;</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰大选最新动态显示，国家党领袖克里斯托弗·卢克森表示，他将“很快”致电工党党魁克里斯·希普金斯的夫人黄琴来。此举可能涉及组阁谈判或政治礼仪，备受媒体关注，预示着选后政治格局的进一步发展。（新西兰媒体报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/politics/361056724/live-updates-election-night-blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“机遇”号慈善机构在议会面临严峻质询</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Opportunity faces the big questions at Parliament</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰慈善机构“机遇”（Opportunity）在国会面临议员们的严峻质询，针对其运营和资金使用等问题进行回应。这凸显了慈善组织在透明度和问责制方面所面临的挑战，以及政府对其监管的重视。（新西兰媒体报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwrkygrxp11mo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">南非非洲人国民大会在地方选举中遭遇历史最差结果</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">South Africa&#x27;s ANC records worst-ever results in local elections</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">南非执政党非洲人国民大会（ANC）在近期举行的地方选举中表现不佳，录得自该党执政以来的最差成绩。这反映出民众对政府的不满情绪日益增长，预示着南非政治格局可能面临重大调整。（非洲媒体报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c65yn1v99ypmo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">胡塞武装称沙特空袭造成至少33人死亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Houthis say at least 33 killed in Saudi air strike</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">也门胡塞武装声称，沙特领导的联军发动的一场空袭造成至少33人死亡。此次事件加剧了也门冲突的人道主义危机，并可能进一步升级地区紧张局势，引发国际社会对平民伤亡的关注。（中东媒体报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c68jzzvjgdy9o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴拉圭前总统卡特斯因银行倒闭被起诉</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Paraguay&#x27;s former president charged after bank collapse</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴拉圭前总统奥拉시오·卡特斯被指控涉及一家银行倒闭事件，此事引发了对该国金融监管和政治腐败的关注。此次起诉标志着对其执政时期经济决策的深入审查。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/8/president-milei-welcomes-pope-leo-during-historic-visit-to-argentina?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">阿根廷总统米莱历史性访问梵蒂冈，会晤教皇方济各</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">President Milei welcomes Pope Leo during historic visit to Argentina</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">阿根廷总统哈维尔·米莱在一次历史性访问中与教皇方济各会晤，凸显了阿根廷与梵蒂冈之间复杂而重要的关系。此次会面或将影响阿根廷国内政治和教会的未来走向。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
